                                "sense_id": "d07da43c-e405-39a5-bbce-86ea58e011df",
                                "text": "What makes it so painful to predict his future candidly is the fact that this Russian Byronizing tradition has an undercurrent of unconscious self-destructiveness, constantly oscillating between would-be folk hero and would-be martyr,[…]"
